From 84550b1fee4d93f0d7c84cf627f158df8fe529dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 15:17:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual selection for pane text yanking

Terminal command mode supports characterwise, linewise, and block visual selection over the focused pane. The UI records the rendered pane text, highlights the selected range, clears stale selections on mouse focus changes, and emits clipboard updates after yank operations.
